{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46119","headline":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 二 · 贯休","name":"寿春节进大蜀皇帝五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异香滴露降纷纷，紫电环枢照禁门。\n先冠百王临亿兆，後称十号震乾坤。\n羲轩之道方爲道，草木沾恩始是恩。\n今以謏才歌睿德，犹如饮海妙难论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}